{
  "name": "semaplc",
  "displayName": "SemaPLC",
  "description": "AI 驱动的 IEC 61131-3 ST 开发环境:对话写码、梯形图预览、一键编译运行",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "publisher": "semaplc",
  "license": "MIT",
  "private": true,
  "icon": "images/icon.png",
  "galleryBanner": {
    "color": "#5BB8E5",
    "theme": "light"
  },
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/midea-ai/SemaPLC.git"
  },
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/midea-ai/SemaPLC/issues"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/midea-ai/SemaPLC/tree/main/sema-plc-vscode#readme",
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.106.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Programming Languages",
    "Other"
  ],
  "keywords": [
    "PLC",
    "IEC 61131-3",
    "Structured Text",
    "OpenPLC",
    "ladder"
  ],
  "activationEvents": [
    "onStartupFinished",
    "onLanguage:st",
    "workspaceContains:.sema/.mcp.json"
  ],
  "main": "./dist/extension.js",
  "contributes": {
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "semaplc.open",
        "title": "SemaPLC: Open IDE Panel"
      },
      {
        "command": "semaplc.runtime.start",
        "title": "SemaPLC: Start PLC Runtime"
      },
      {
        "command": "semaplc.runtime.stop",
        "title": "SemaPLC: Stop PLC Runtime"
      },
      {
        "command": "semaplc.runtime.rebuild",
        "title": "SemaPLC: Rebuild Runtime Image"
      },
      {
        "command": "semaplc.setApiKey",
        "title": "SemaPLC: Set LLM API Key"
      },
      {
        "command": "semaplc.check",
        "category": "SemaPLC",
        "title": "Check Current ST File"
      },
      {
        "command": "semaplc.newSession",
        "category": "SemaPLC",
        "title": "New Session (resets workspace)",
        "icon": "$(add)"
      },
      {
        "command": "semaplc.settings",
        "category": "SemaPLC",
        "title": "Settings",
        "icon": "$(gear)"
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "view/title": [
        {
          "command": "semaplc.newSession",
          "when": "view == semaplc.chat",
          "group": "navigation@1"
        },
        {
          "command": "semaplc.settings",
          "when": "view == semaplc.chat",
          "group": "navigation@2"
        }
      ]
    },
    "snippets": [
      {
        "language": "st",
        "path": "./snippets/st.json"
      }
    ],
    "languages": [
      {
        "id": "st",
        "extensions": [
          ".st"
        ],
        "aliases": [
          "Structured Text",
          "IEC 61131-3 ST"
        ],
        "configuration": "./syntaxes/language-configuration.json"
      }
    ],
    "grammars": [
      {
        "language": "st",
        "scopeName": "source.st",
        "path": "./syntaxes/st.tmLanguage.json"
      }
    ],
    "mcpServerDefinitionProviders": [
      {
        "id": "semaplc.plcTools",
        "label": "SemaPLC PLC Tools"
      }
    ],
    "configuration": {
      "title": "SemaPLC",
      "properties": {
        "semaplc.workspace": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "markdownDescription": "PLC 工作区路径。留空时:当前文件夹已是 PLC 工作区(有 `.sema/.mcp.json`)就用它,否则用扩展专属目录,**不会**动你打开的代码库。相对路径按当前文件夹解析。\n\n⚠️ 面板的「重置」会删光工作区目录下的全部内容,指向自己的项目前请确认。"
        },
        "semaplc.model": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "deepseek",
          "markdownDescription": "默认 LLM 模型(对应 server 的 PLC_MODEL)。**没显式改过**这一项时,`semaplc.envFile` 里的 `PLC_MODEL` 优先。"
        },
        "semaplc.envFile": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "scope": "machine",
          "markdownDescription": "一个 `.env` 文件路径,里面的 `*_API_KEY` / `PLC_*` 会注入本地 server(支持 `~/`,相对路径按当前文件夹解析)。\n\n用来复用你已有的配置,例如 `~/SemaPLC/sema-plc-web/.env`,省得把 key 再填一遍。改完需要重载窗口。\n\n优先级:插件里用「设置 LLM API Key」存的 key > 本文件 > 继承的 shell 环境。`PORT` / `WS_PORT` / `SEMAPLC_DATA_DIR` / `PLC_WORKSPACE` 等由扩展控制,写在文件里也会被忽略。\n\n⚠️ 仅用户/机器级设置有效:workspace 设置可改就等于「克隆仓库 = 让你读任意文件并把内容注入子进程环境」。"
        },
        "semaplc.container.bin": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "scope": "machine",
          "description": "容器可执行文件(docker / podman;留空=自动探测)。仅用户/机器级设置有效:保存 .st 会自动执行它,workspace 设置可改就等于「克隆仓库 + Ctrl+S = 跑任意二进制」。"
        },
        "semaplc.container.name": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "openplc-plc-dev",
          "scope": "machine",
          "description": "PLC 运行时容器名(对应 PLC_CONTAINER)。同上,machine scope 挡住 .vscode/settings.json 改它。"
        },
        "semaplc.plcUrl": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "https://localhost:8443",
          "description": "OpenPLC REST 地址(对应 PLC_URL;指向远程/实机时本地可无容器)"
        },
        "semaplc.check.onSave": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "markdownDescription": "保存 .st 时自动跑 `plc --check`,结果进 Problems 面板。\n\n⚠️ 目前只对**单文件工程**有意义:检查是单文件送检的,保存一个引用了兄弟文件里 FUNCTION_BLOCK 的 `main.st` 会满屏假错。多文件工程请用命令 `SemaPLC: Check Current ST File` 手动触发。"
        },
        "semaplc.runtime.stopOnExit": {
          "type": "boolean",
          "default": false,
          "description": "退出 VSCode 时停止 PLC 运行时容器"
        }
      }
    },
    "viewsContainers": {
      "secondarySidebar": [
        {
          "id": "semaplc",
          "title": "SemaPLC",
          "icon": "resources/activitybar.svg"
        }
      ]
    },
    "views": {
      "semaplc": [
        {
          "id": "semaplc.chat",
          "name": "对话",
          "type": "webview"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node esbuild.mjs",
    "watch": "node esbuild.mjs --watch",
    "typecheck": "tsc --noEmit",
    "test": "node --test test/*.test.mjs",
    "vscode:prepublish": "node esbuild.mjs"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/node": "^20.14.0",
    "@types/vscode": "^1.106.0",
    "@types/ws": "^8.18.1",
    "esbuild": "^0.24.0",
    "typescript": "^5.6.0"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "ws": "^8.21.1"
  }
}
